            <ArticleTitle>Wrist pain: a systematic approach to diagnosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>42-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Numerous radiographic procedures are now available to help determine the cause of wrist pain. This paper presents a wrist-pain algorithm that defines the relative roles of various radiographic techniques in the evaluation of patients with wrist pain. Practical application of the algorithm is demonstrated through illustrative cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
